 :itonami.blueprint/implemented-slice
 "src/marketentry/* (langgraph-clj StateGraph actor, compiled via
 `operation/build` -> `g/state-graph` -> `g/compile-graph` with
 `interrupt-before #{:request-approval}`): facts.cljc (official
 spec-basis catalog -- verified-facts-only: no dedicated
 'aanbestedingswet'/procurement-regulator exists for Suriname
 (exhaustively checked against De Nationale Assemblee's own complete
 law index), so procurement is grounded in the Comptabiliteitswet 1952
 + Comptabiliteitsbesluit (G.B. 1953 no. 100) instead; KKF/Wet Kamers
 van Koophandel 1962 for business registration; Belastingdienst for tax
 registration (Inkomstenbelasting 1922/Wet Loonbelasting/Wet
 Omzetbelasting 1997); Investeringswet 2001 + Investsur for investment
 -- see docs/adr/0001-architecture.md), governor.cljc (Market-Entry
 Compliance Governor -- spec-basis HARD check, evidence-incomplete HARD
 check, `:procurement-threshold-noncompliant` HARD check independently
 recomputing the Comptabiliteitsbesluit Artikel 18 SRD 4,000/SRD 30,000
 three-tier threshold -- the FLAGSHIP check for this vertical --,
 engagement-fee-mismatch independent recompute, `:tax-registration-
 unconfirmed` HARD check (Belastingdienst, unconditional), confidence-
 floor/actuation gate, plus double-draft/double-submit guards),
 store.cljc (MemStore + DatomicStore via
 `io.github.kotoba-lang/langchain-store`), registry.cljc (pure-function
 filing-draft/filing-submit record construction + fee recompute +
 procurement-threshold-noncompliant? three-tier pure predicate),
 marketentryllm.cljc (mock MarketEntry Advisor), operation.cljc (intake
 -> advise -> govern -> decide -> [request-approval ->] commit/hold
 StateGraph), phase.cljc (0->3 rollout, `:filing/draft`/`:filing/submit`
 permanently excluded from every phase's `:auto` set). Tests cover:
 governor contract (including all three tiers of the flagship
 procurement-threshold check in both compliant/noncompliant directions),
 store parity, facts, phase, registry -- plus this repo's separate
 `culture`/`statute` domain namespaces, left untouched. clj-kondo
 clean."}
